: null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "mavsdk_server show's this error `Unknown mav_frame enum value: 12 (telemetry_service_impl.h:648)` when `offboard.set_velocity_ned` or `offboard.set_velocity_body` is used on fixed-wing aircraft through MAVSDK-Python. QGC shows the fixed-wing drone being put into landing mode as soon as the error appears in the terminal.\r\n\r\nPython snippet\r\n```python\r\nawait drone.offboard.set_velocity_ned(offboard.VelocityNedYaw(0,0,0,0))   \r\nawait drone.offboard.start()\r\nawait drone.offboard.set_velocity_ned(offboard.VelocityNedYaw(20,0,-1,0))\r\n```\r\nmavsdk_server output\r\n```\r\n\u001b[34m[02:47:37|Info ] \u001b[0mMAVSDK version: 0.28.0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:26)\r\n\u001b[32m[02:47:37|Debug] \u001b[0mNew: System ID: 0 Comp ID: 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:377)\r\n\u001b[34m[02:47:37|Info ] \u001b[0mServer started (grpc_server.cpp:43)\r\n\u001b[34m[02:47:37|Info ] \u001b[0mServer set to listen on 0.0.0.0:50040 (grpc_server.cpp:44)\r\n\u001b[34m[02:47:37|Info ] \u001b[0mWaiting to discover system on udp://:14540... (connection_initiator.h:22)\r\n\u001b[34m[02:47:37|Info ] \u001b[0mNew system on: 127.0.0.1:14580 (udp_connection.cpp:256)\r\n\u001b[32m[02:47:37|Debug] \u001b[0mComponent Autopilot (1) added. (system_impl.cpp:352)\r\n\u001b[32m[02:47:37|Debug] \u001b[0mDiscovered 1 component(s) (UUID: 5283920058631409231) (system_impl.cpp:525)\r\n\u001b[34m[02:47:37|Info ] \u001b[0mSystem discovered [UUID: 5283920058631409231] (connection_initiator.h:61)\r\n\u001b[33m[02:47:38|Warn ] \u001b[0mcommand denied (512). (mavlink_commands.cpp:158)\r\n\u001b[32m[02:47:38|Debug] \u001b[0mFalling back to Gimbal Version 1 (gimbal_impl.cpp:53)\r\n\u001b[31m[02:47:49|Error] \u001b[0mUnknown mav_frame enum value: 12 (telemetry_service_impl.h:648)\r\n\u001b[31m[02:47:49|Error] \u001b[0mUnknown mav_frame en